OL,3,AJamaica to bring slavery reparations
OL,4,Apetition to King Charles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Jamaican government will highlight
OL,7,Fto King Charles a petition over slavery
OL,8,Freparations on Monday, the country's
OL,9,Fculture minister Olivia Grange has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FIt will ask the King, who serves as
OL,13,FJamaica's head of state, to refer three
OL,14,Fquestions to the Judicial Committee of
OL,15,Fthe Privy Council, the country's
OL,16,Fhighest court, over the legality of the
OL,17,Fenslavement of Africans in Jamaica.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
